                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino ndakabona kuti atala lyamweenya oyo iwakali kujulu lyamitwe yabakerebimu akaboneka cintu cili mbuli ibbwe lya-Safiro, cakali mbuli cuuno cabwami. ",
