        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela bakerebimu nibakazwa, bakatandabika mababa aabo akuuluka kuzwa ansi mumeso aangu, aalo mavwili akeenda kumbali lyabo. Bakaakwiima kumulyango wakujwe waŋanda ya-Jehova, nkabela bulemu bwa-Leza wa-Israyeli bwakali kujulu lyabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
